        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Skirt piece of green Bokhara silk embroidered in red silk entirely in chain stitch. The skirt is covered with close horizontal rows of plain 'cone' pattern. The bottom border has an edging of cones and leaves above a band of rosettes and five-pointed leaves within hexagonal compartments."@en ;
